  "description": "Umbraco-native e-learning / LMS package. Author courses, modules, lessons and assessments as content; deliver them to Members with progress tracking, nine assessment question types, brand-driven UI, certificates, CSV learner onboarding and optional Stripe payments — via a guided installer.",
