  "releaseNotes": "0.11.0-beta.3 — private pre-release for first-client pilot (not for public Marketplace; all umbraco* tags stripped). Installer no longer aborts when a host site already owns a doc-type alias (e.g. contentPage). Course content model, nine assessment question types, progress tracking, certificates, two-colour brandable UI + brand font, CSV learner onboarding, lifecycle emails, SCORM 1.2 import/consume, and optional Stripe payments. See CHANGELOG.md.",
